9
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,340
It's great to work with you

10
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,580
What are you afraid of?

11
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,580
Even though the blindfold is like a shadow, it still can’t protect me

12
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:42,670
Shadow tail is not good at attacking from the front

13
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:44,670
I thought the adults blew themselves up ten miles away from home

14
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:46,670
Dare to take pictures with hundreds of thousands of people

15
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:48,670
It's all thanks to Xiazi following him.
